mac80211 rate control for the wonder driver.

vendor/sun_perf.config ships mac80211 with no rate control algorithm at all
(CONFIG_MAC80211_RC_MINSTREL not set, RC_DEFAULT empty). Nothing on this product
used mac80211 before, so it did not matter. wonder.ko is a mac80211 driver and
ieee80211_register_hw() refuses to register without at least one algorithm, so it
could never come up: observed on hardware as

    ieee80211 wonder: Failed to select rate control algorithm
    [wonder][mac80211] Failed to register mac80211 hardware. Ret: -2

Fix: select minstrel_ht (CONFIG_MAC80211_RC_DEFAULT="minstrel_ht" is the name the
algorithm registers under).

Verified after rebuild:
  - regenerated .config has CONFIG_MAC80211_RC_MINSTREL=y, RC_DEFAULT="minstrel_ht"
  - mac80211.ko now contains 141 minstrel strings (was 0)
  - exports unchanged: 136/136 symbols, every CRC identical to the stock module
  - imports +2 (kmalloc_large, param_ops_bool), both inside the KMI whitelist
  - vermagic unchanged

Apply from kernel_platform/msm-kernel (its own git repository):
    git apply .../0004-mac80211-rate-control-for-wonder.patch

diff --git a/arch/arm64/configs/vendor/sun_perf.config b/arch/arm64/configs/vendor/sun_perf.config
index 61288b2fd..97f6487cc 100644
--- a/arch/arm64/configs/vendor/sun_perf.config
+++ b/arch/arm64/configs/vendor/sun_perf.config
@@ -101,8 +101,11 @@ CONFIG_MAC80211=m
 # CONFIG_MAC80211_LEDS is not set
 # CONFIG_MAC80211_MESH is not set
 # CONFIG_MAC80211_MESSAGE_TRACING is not set
-CONFIG_MAC80211_RC_DEFAULT=""
-# CONFIG_MAC80211_RC_MINSTREL is not set
+# Enabled for the wonder mac80211 driver: it cannot register without a
+# rate control algorithm. Empty by default on this product.
+CONFIG_MAC80211_RC_DEFAULT="minstrel_ht"
+CONFIG_MAC80211_RC_DEFAULT_MINSTREL=y
+CONFIG_MAC80211_RC_MINSTREL=y
 CONFIG_MAX31760_FAN_CONTROLLER=m
 CONFIG_MEM_SHARE_QMI_SERVICE=m
 CONFIG_MFD_I2C_PMIC=m
